des that can completely change the look and feel of your photos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gain Experience &amp; Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill daily tasks, complete objectives, or turn on the radio and watch the day go by as nature lives on around you. Leveling up earns you credits which can be used to improve your camera, purchase amenities at the lodge, build up your card collection, and even unlock the power to change the weather and time of day on a whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/132bd2c63592d08553ed339df9357968.poster.avif?t=1771890825\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/132bd2c63592d08553ed339df9357968.webm?t=1771890825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116610/extras/132bd2c63592d08553ed339df9357968.mp4?t=1771890825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photography Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully unlocked abilities, you'll have the freedom to change the time of day and weather, tweak the processing to fit the mood, and call on a specific animal species to be your subject.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax &amp; Unwind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seclusa is designed to be a stress-free, predominantly point &amp; click experience, complete with immersive African soundscapes and an original soundtrack. Snap photos, work on your card collection, and get cozy with a jigsaw puzzle. You're on safari, enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto